---
const { compact=false }=Astro.props;
---
<section class:list={['lead-magnet',{compact}]}>
  <div class="lead-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Le point de départ</span><h2>12 prompts utiles.<br/><span>0 jargon.</span></h2><p>Un petit kit pour passer de « je teste l’IA » à « j’ai créé quelque chose ».</p><ul><li>12 prompts prêts à adapter</li><li>Une méthode simple en 3 étapes</li><li>Une checklist avant de cliquer sur Générer</li></ul><form action="mailto:papynotion@gmail.com" method="post" enctype="text/plain"><label for="kit-email">Ton adresse e-mail</label><div><input id="kit-email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="toi@exemple.com" required/><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Je veux le kit →</button></div></form><small>Gratuit · Ton application e-mail s’ouvrira pour confirmer la demande.</small></div>
  <div class="lead-visual"><img src="/editorial/starter-kit.webp" alt="Aperçu du kit de démarrage Papy AI" width="900" height="675" loading="lazy"/><span>GRATUIT</span></div>
</section>
<style>
  .lead-magnet{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;min-height:510px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-radius:30px;background:#f9f6f4;color:#0a0823}.lead-copy{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:clamp(30px,5vw,65px)}.lead-copy :global(.eyebrow){color:#b74200}.lead-copy h2{margin:10px 0 18px}.lead-copy h2 span{color:#ef551a}.lead-copy p{font-size:1.05rem;color:#4e4a58;max-width:520px}.lead-copy ul{padding:0;list-style:none;display:grid;gap:8px;color:#35313e}.lead-copy li:before{content:"✓";color:#ef551a;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px}.lead-copy form{margin-top:18px}.lead-copy label{display:block;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;margin-bottom:6px}.lead-copy form>div{display:flex;gap:8px}.lead-copy input{min-width:0;flex:1;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid rgba(10,8,35,.18);border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#0a0823;outline:none}.lead-copy input:focus{border-color:#ef551a;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(239,85,26,.12)}.lead-copy form .btn{padding:11px 16px}.lead-copy small{margin-top:10px;color:#77727f}.lead-visual{position:relative;min-height:360px;background:#090851}.lead-visual img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.lead-visual span{position:absolute;right:20px;top:20px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:#ff7a00;color:#090851;font-weight:900;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.1em}.compact{min-height:420px}
  @media(max-width:780px){.lead-magnet{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lead-visual{order:-1;min-height:260px}.lead-copy{padding:30px 24px}.lead-copy h2{font-size:2.5rem}.lead-copy form>div{display:grid}.lead-copy form .btn{width:100%}}
</style>
